### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@doctorId = fb958022-f994-4e59-899e-1e46d9efd87e
@doctor2 = a7a04e33-3575-422c-837f-5a5a27dbc1f7

@patientId = c0436a7c-67a8-451e-b733-fc3082c43262

### 1. Book an Appointment (2026-09-21, 09:30:00 - 10:00:00)
# @name bookAppointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctor2}}",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-12-30",
  "startTime": "12:00:00",
  "endTime": "12:00:00",
  "reason": "Follow-up consultation for persistent headaches"
}

### 2. Confirm an Appointment
# Replace {{appointmentId}} with the UUID from booking response
@appointmentId = 6a86967f-cf04-4ed4-a8e1-a1c20e5b925e
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/confirm

### 3. Start an Appointment (Doctor consultation begins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/start

### 4. Cancel an Appointment (With cancellation reason)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Patient requested cancellation due to personal emergency"
}

### 5. Get Appointment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}

### 6. Query Appointments by Doctor & Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?doctorId={{doctor2}}&date=2026-11-24

### 7. Query Appointments by Patient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?patientId={{patientId}}

### 8. Query Appointments by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?status=SCHEDULED&page=0&size=10

### 9. Attempt Conflicting Booking (Should return 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "doctorId": "{{doctorId}}",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-09-21",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "09:30:00",
  "reason": "Conflicting slot booking attempt"
}
